1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,060
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

2
00:00:23,559 --> 00:00:26,920
This world overflows with vibrant colors

3
00:00:26,920 --> 00:00:29,900
Truth and lies deceive our eyes

4
00:00:29,900 --> 00:00:32,940
Use your heart and look carefully

5
00:00:32,940 --> 00:00:35,920
The truth is not far from sight

6
00:00:35,920 --> 00:00:38,920
Hey you good or bad, true or false

7
00:00:38,920 --> 00:00:41,920
Can't escape the haze in your mind

8
00:00:41,920 --> 00:00:44,920
Bring all your courage

9
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:47,920
Maybe you can save this world

10
00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:50,299
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

11
00:00:50,299 --> 00:00:53,680
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

12
00:00:53,680 --> 00:00:56,620
Mojo Mojo Mojo Spy

13
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:58,900
For just fine

14
00:01:12,900 --> 00:01:14,900
They found a fragment of The Illumin Doctrine in Jingjing's pocket

15
00:01:17,900 --> 00:01:21,000
Jimmy Chen took out a hidden ancient fragment and finally completed The Illumin Doctrine

16
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:25,000
And told Officer Han about Locky's extraordinary origins

17
00:01:26,620 --> 00:01:31,260
Then an archaeologist who could decipher The Illumin Doctrine appeared

18
00:01:35,299 --> 00:01:36,299
Scholar Yan's visit

19
00:01:48,299 --> 00:01:49,340
Based on the files, Scholar Yan has no issues

20
00:01:49,340 --> 00:01:53,439
He's the foremost genius scholar in Chinese archaeology right now

21
00:01:53,439 --> 00:01:56,280
Young as he is, he's published many papers with fresh perspectives

22
00:01:56,280 --> 00:01:58,340
Especially in deciphering

23
00:01:58,340 --> 00:01:59,560
various ancient scripts

24
00:01:59,560 --> 00:02:00,920
He's very accomplished

25
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:05,579
Mm, no wonder The Illumin-Eye found him

26
00:02:05,579 --> 00:02:07,000
Okay.

27
00:02:07,000 --> 00:02:08,699
Then I'll arrange for tomorrow

28
00:02:08,699 --> 00:02:09,460
with Scholar Yan

29
00:02:09,460 --> 00:02:10,800
at Tuna Bank.

30
00:02:10,800 --> 00:02:12,800
The Illumin-Eye deal is there.

31
00:02:12,800 --> 00:02:13,520
We have to be careful.

32
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:16,659
We can't let The Illumin-Eye get an opening.

33
00:02:16,659 --> 00:02:18,259
Uncle, uncle!

34
00:02:18,259 --> 00:02:21,500
Is there anything we can do?

35
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:23,699
Uh, you

36
00:02:23,699 --> 00:02:26,020
go finish your homework first.

37
00:02:26,280 --> 00:02:27,759
Bad uncle!

38
00:02:27,759 --> 00:02:28,979
Locky,

39
00:02:28,979 --> 00:02:31,900
I need your help with something.

40
00:02:40,900 --> 00:02:42,159
Since when did they become so close?

41
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:50,520
So, what do you think of this Scholar Yan?

42
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:52,840
Hmm, Scholar Yan.

43
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:56,879
Uncle seems to really trust him.

44
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:58,780
Think it over carefully and you'll see

45
00:02:58,780 --> 00:03:00,960
everything has gone too smoothly.

46
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,879
It all feels like

47
00:03:02,879 --> 00:03:04,400
like it was all set up long ago.

48
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:05,280
Exactly.

49
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:09,340
Plus, there's definitely something fishy about Mr. K's earlier confession.

50
00:03:12,300 --> 00:03:13,740
Wow, beautiful.

51
00:03:13,740 --> 00:03:15,680
What's this?

52
00:03:15,680 --> 00:03:19,180
This is a sample of the powerful anesthetic Dorothy used

53
00:03:19,180 --> 00:03:21,240
during her last museum theft.

54
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:26,180
This anesthetic makes anyone who smells it pass out in just seconds.

55
00:03:26,180 --> 00:03:29,560
I've been rushing to develop an antidote these past few days.

56
00:03:29,560 --> 00:03:31,820
It'll be done before long.

57
00:03:31,820 --> 00:03:35,060
The task of watching the Illumin-Eye is yours now.

58
00:03:35,060 --> 00:03:40,780
You're always doing things behind everyone's backs.

59
00:03:40,780 --> 00:03:45,500
Is this Scholar Yan actually up to something?

60
00:03:45,500 --> 00:03:46,200
Locky

61
00:03:46,259 --> 00:03:54,500
Weren't you two hiding across from the museum watching the Illumin-Eye's movements?

62
00:03:54,500 --> 00:03:57,359
That lookout point was already compromised.

63
00:03:57,359 --> 00:04:00,699
So I had to bring him back.

64
00:04:00,699 --> 00:04:03,379
What are you doing here?

65
00:04:03,379 --> 00:04:04,399
Have you finished your homework?

66
00:04:04,399 --> 00:04:06,479
Annoying!

67
00:04:06,479 --> 00:04:10,799
You and Uncle are both the same kind of annoying.

68
00:04:11,939 --> 00:04:13,519
Locky, wait for me!

69
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:16,400
They never listen to you.

70
00:04:16,400 --> 00:04:17,840
Cut the chatter.

71
00:04:17,840 --> 00:04:18,939
Quick, come with me.

72
00:04:32,899 --> 00:04:33,699
Mr.K

73
00:04:33,699 --> 00:04:35,160
How have you been?

74
00:04:35,160 --> 00:04:36,840
You!

75
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:38,500
What are you going to do?

76
00:04:38,500 --> 00:04:40,100
Lord Eye has decided

77
00:04:40,100 --> 00:04:41,860
As long as you keep cooperating obediently

78
00:04:41,860 --> 00:04:43,280
He can let bygones be bygones

79
00:04:43,280 --> 00:04:52,140
I'm sure you know what happens to those who betray the organization

80
00:05:06,200 --> 00:05:08,300
Scholar Yan will arrive on time tomorrow

81
00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:10,500
Everything will go according to plan

82
00:05:10,579 --> 00:05:15,459
Scholar Yan, could it be...?

83
00:05:15,459 --> 00:05:22,279
What's wrong? What's that sound?

84
00:05:22,279 --> 00:05:24,839
What's going on?

85
00:05:24,839 --> 00:05:29,019
I... I accidentally farted

86
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:56,039
Scholar Yan, hello

87
00:05:56,039 --> 00:05:56,639
Hello

88
00:05:56,639 --> 00:05:57,779
Hello

89
00:05:57,779 --> 00:06:02,959
You must be this town's famous police beauty, Miss Han

90
00:06:02,959 --> 00:06:04,039
Nice to meet you, nice to meet you

91
00:06:04,039 --> 00:06:07,000
Uh... your eyes

92
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:08,879
My eyes?

93
00:06:08,879 --> 00:06:18,540
Oh, I lost my sight by accident during an archaeological dig. Fortunately, I have this — the Blind Man's Gospel. It scans images directly into my brain.

94
00:06:20,019 --> 00:06:22,819
Oh, I'm so sorry for bringing up painful memories

95
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:27,519
It's fine. Aren't I pretty much the same as you normal people now?

96
00:06:28,819 --> 00:06:30,860
Well then, we'll be counting on you today

97
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,699
You're too kind

98
00:06:41,899 --> 00:06:43,120
Ah, what's taking him so long?

99
00:06:43,120 --> 00:06:47,879
Please, come in

100
00:06:47,879 --> 00:06:52,639
It's such an honor to meet you

101
00:06:52,639 --> 00:06:55,480
I'm your biggest fan!

102
00:06:55,480 --> 00:06:56,560
I was in the balloon—

103
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,120
No, no, no

104
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:59,879
I've seen you on TV many times

105
00:06:59,879 --> 00:07:03,399
A pleasure to meet you

106
00:07:03,399 --> 00:07:05,279
Could I possibly ask for

107
00:07:05,279 --> 00:07:07,719
a personal item of yours as a keepsake?

108
00:07:07,720 --> 00:07:10,000
Mr. K, don't push it.

109
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:12,140
Forget it, it's no trouble.

110
00:07:12,140 --> 00:07:15,060
Would this work?

111
00:07:15,060 --> 00:07:17,900
Ah, thank you so much!

112
00:07:17,900 --> 00:07:24,860
Let's begin, Miss Han.

113
00:07:24,860 --> 00:07:25,220
Very well.

114
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:36,500
Scholar Yan, are you all right?

115
00:07:36,500 --> 00:07:38,819
I apologize

116
00:07:38,819 --> 00:07:40,959
I got a little carried away

117
00:07:40,959 --> 00:07:43,759
But I truly am delighted

118
00:07:43,759 --> 00:07:45,959
to have the honor of witnessing and translating

119
00:07:45,959 --> 00:07:48,519
this remarkable ancient book of great significance

120
00:07:48,519 --> 00:07:53,120
So you truly can read this ancient text?

121
00:07:53,120 --> 00:07:56,699
Yes, I can generally translate it

122
00:07:56,699 --> 00:07:59,240
But the book says a full translation

123
00:07:59,240 --> 00:08:01,120
requires an ancient sword

124
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,240
The Eternal Flame

125
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:04,240
Yes, that very sword!

126
00:08:06,500 --> 00:08:21,920
Report, Captain Han.

127
00:08:21,920 --> 00:08:24,819
Can I go to the restroom?

128
00:08:24,819 --> 00:08:29,939
Okay, Scholar Yan.

129
00:08:29,939 --> 00:08:31,579
Can we start?

130
00:08:31,579 --> 00:08:33,080
Sure.

131
00:08:33,080 --> 00:08:34,659
Hurry up.

132
00:08:34,659 --> 00:08:36,259
Alright, alright, right away.

133
00:08:36,259 --> 00:08:54,399
Help!

134
00:08:54,399 --> 00:08:55,259
Don't kill me!

135
00:08:55,259 --> 00:08:56,200
Help!

136
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:56,600
What's wrong?

137
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:57,600
Don't you recognize me?

138
00:09:06,600 --> 00:09:07,600
Locky...

139
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:09,600
There's a suspicious figure in the restroom.

140
00:09:16,600 --> 00:09:17,600
What's wrong?

141
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,600
Yan, Scholar Yan, you...

142
00:09:26,600 --> 00:09:28,600
Oh no, anesthetic!

143
00:09:35,800 --> 00:09:38,600
Lord Eye truly has a brilliant plan, huh?

144
00:09:40,600 --> 00:09:49,600
Ending song

145
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:52,600
I really don't want to

146
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:56,019
Be lonely and alone

147
00:09:56,019 --> 00:09:59,519
The life back then

148
00:09:59,519 --> 00:10:03,940
Is bound to be a little unhappy

149
00:10:03,940 --> 00:10:07,040
Saying goodbye to today

150
00:10:07,040 --> 00:10:11,460
Always makes you feel lost

151
00:10:11,460 --> 00:10:14,879
Look at tomorrow

152
00:10:14,879 --> 00:10:19,200
Waving to me at your horizon

153
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:22,940
Every day is just sunrise and sunset

154
00:10:22,940 --> 00:10:26,940
Turning through time, dreaming ever more

155
00:10:26,940 --> 00:10:31,980
Awaiting every second, every moment of life

156
00:10:31,980 --> 00:10:38,700
Bright eyes are sparkling

157
00:10:38,700 --> 00:10:42,080
A smile reflecting the sunlight

158
00:10:42,080 --> 00:10:47,280
Breaking through the bridge at the silent crossroads

159
00:10:49,200 --> 00:11:19,180
Chinese Subtitle Volunteer: Yang Qianqian